        "Your doom has no stack limit. The first 8 stacks deal full damage per tick. Each additional stack beyond 8 adds damage at 50% effectiveness, naturally plateauing around 30–40 stacks. The light frame's 1s tick interval gains 500ms (1.5s live total), preserving the same total damage while extending the cadence. Rewards long, sustained fights.",
